  "sentences": [
    {
      "block": 0,
      "text": "I found this interesting, almost all sites that don\u2019t take up the whole screen are fit to an 800x600 screen resolution.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.8
    },
    {
      "block": 0,
      "text": "I think the last time I myself used this screen resolution was 10 years ago.",
      "start": 6.98,
      "end": 11.54
    },
    {
      "block": 0,
      "text": "It seems that only 12% of people today still use this screen resolution.",
      "start": 11.72,
      "end": 16.12
    },
    {
      "block": 0,
      "text": "And there\u2019s a good chance that of that 12% of users most of them are not very tech savvy.",
      "start": 16.3,
      "end": 21.02
    },
    {
      "block": 0,
      "text": "So if you have a technology related site, or are selling software online.",
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 25.44
    },
    {
      "block": 0,
      "text": "You might as well make your site look better for the masses and build it to fit 1024x768 instead.",
